{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34011","headline":"寄题镜岩周尊师所居 · 皮日休","name":"寄题镜岩周尊师所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八十余年住镜岩，鹿皮巾下雪髟髟。\n牀寒不奈云萦枕，经润何妨雨滴函。\n饮涧猨回窥绝洞，缘梯人歇倚危杉。\n如何计吏穷於鸟，欲望仙都举一帆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}